    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superstellar offers a fresh take on the survivor genre with its advanced stat synergies, extensive build diversity and crucial player choice. Roam endless space and engage in frantic combat with responsive, racing-like movement. Complete missions and milestones to unlock new spaceships, each equipped with new weapons and exclusive upgrade choices. Choose your upgrades wisely and fight to stay alive as long as possible against hordes of pesky enemies! Runs typically last about 20 minutes, but skilled players might endure a bit longer.     <br> <br><i>How long can you survive?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301650/extras/ce20d5abc60d29e8e3a57c54c573e0bd.poster.avif?t=1749421585\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301650/extras/ce20d5abc60d29e8e3a57c54c573e0bd.webm?t=1749421585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301650/extras/ce20d5abc60d29e8e3a57c54c573e0bd.mp4?t=1749421585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong><u> Gameplay &amp; Combat</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless battles\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Survive as long as possible in a randomly generated space environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive enemy waves</strong> \u2013 Face over 500 enemies at once!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy territories</strong> \u2013 Each with unique enemies, events and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic events</strong> - Adapt to hazards like solar flares, asteroid belts, darkness, and radiation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All out war\u00a0</strong>\u2013 A randomized brutal mode that combines all enemy territories into one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301650/extras/b54b143757e4a177a36e9415ec26248a.avif?t=1749421585\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong><u>Ships &amp; Classes</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Orion</strong> \u2013 Energy and electricity-based, specializing in electrocution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Phoenix </strong>\u2013 Fire-based, focused on igniting and burning enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2744\ufe0f Titan\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Ice and summoner-based, capable of chilling, freezing, and shattering foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship boasts a game-changing ultimate ability aswell, and comes in light, medium, and heavy armored variants with different stats and ability enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301650/extras/92e375803e8aa51c92de30dabe228bae.avif?t=1749421585\" width=500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong><u>Customization &amp; Build Diversity</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 weapons</strong> \u2013 Each with different rarity tiers, effects, and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>75  unique passives</strong> \u2013 Alter stats, gain powerful bonuses, and create  new synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 player stats</strong> \u2013 Designed for deep interactions, ensuring every stat matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized modifiers</strong> \u2013 Adapt and optimize your build with every level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301650/extras/3edd2e1b165a2d288ba39c7d30f79790.avif?t=1749421585\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong><u>Progression &amp; Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions &amp; milestones</strong> \u2013 Unlock new territories, ships, weapons, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty progression</strong> \u2013 Each unlocked territory increases in challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements</strong> \u2013 Conquer challenges and prove your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High scores </strong>\u2013 Set new records!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad support</strong> \u2013 Seamless  gamepad support, fully optimized for controller play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music in gameplay teaser by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
