g> \u2013 Designed for deep interactions, ensuring every stat matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized modifiers</strong> \u2013 Adapt and optimize your build with every level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301650/extras/3edd2e1b165a2d288ba39c7d30f79790.avif?t=1749421585\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong><u>Progression &amp; Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions &amp; milestones</strong> \u2013 Unlock new territories, ships, weapons, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty progression</strong> \u2013 Each unlocked territory increases in challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements</strong> \u2013 Conquer challenges and prove your mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High scores </strong>\u2013 Set new records!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad support</strong> \u2013 Seamless  gamepad support, fully optimized for controller play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music in gameplay teaser by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
